        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>0-12月龄 宝宝生长发育指南</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      90deg,\n      #efe6dc 0px, #efe6dc 2px,\n      #e8ddd1 2px, #e8ddd1 4px\n    );\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 14px 16px 24px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 8px 0 22px 0;\n  }\n  .title-line1 {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #7b3fa8;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #ffffff;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n  }\n  .title-line2 {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #6fbf5a;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #ffffff;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    padding: 20px 22px 22px 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .card h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #8b2fc9;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .lbl {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #222;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n  .lbl-plain {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .card p {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-block\">\n    <div class=\"title-line1\">0-12月龄</div>\n    <div class=\"title-line2\">宝宝生长发育指南</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h2>三抬头</h2>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl-plain\">推荐方案：</span></p>\n    <p class=\"item\">1.厌奶期：宝宝不吃奶不要强迫，拉开喂奶时间，等宝宝有饥饿感后喂</p>\n    <p class=\"item\">2.口欲期：不要阻止宝宝吃手，可用牙胶，来满足宝宝啃咬需求</p>\n    <p class=\"item\">3.喂养：建立规律喂养习惯，每3个小时喂一次，奶量参考：每次120～150ML</p>\n    <p class=\"item\"><span class=\"lbl\">早教重点</span>：看镜子、练习抓握，叫宝宝名字</p>\n    <p class=\"item\"><span class=\"lbl\">推荐玩具</span>：奥尔夫乐器、曼哈顿球</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h2>四翻身</h2>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl-plain\">推荐方案：</span></p>\n    <p class=\"item\">1.口欲期：宝宝喜欢吃手，啃东西不要直接阻止，保持手部清洁</p>\n    <p class=\"item\">2.认人：看到陌生人会害怕、哭闹，多安抚陪伴很快就会过去</p>\n    <p class=\"item\">3.抱姿：现在竖抱起来脑袋不会晃动，但还是要注意护着宝宝的颈部</p>\n    <p class=\"item\"><span class=\"lbl\">早教重点</span>：多给宝宝照镜子，让宝宝逐渐认识自己，多听儿歌，开始给宝宝读绘本，训练用手撑起身体上半身，多练习翻身</p>\n    <p class=\"item\"><span class=\"lbl\">推荐玩具</span>：布书、抚触球、牙胶</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
